# Application configuration

**Status:** current. Unknown fields are errors (`deny_unknown_fields`).
The complete-shape example is illustrative; the tables are canonical.

```toml
[app]
name = "Datastar"
identifier = "dev.rocci.datastar"
version = "0.1.0"

[[windows]]
label = "main"
title = "Datastar"
url = "/"
width = 1040
height = 760
min_width = 720
min_height = 560
visible = true

[http]
host = "127.0.0.1"
port = 0
redirect_trailing_slash = true

[security]
allowed_origins = []

[assets]
directory = "assets"
embed = true
datastar = "1.0.2"

[development]
reload = false
devtools = false

[bundle]
app = "."
macos_plist = "packaging/macos/Info.plist"
```

## App

| Field | Type | Default | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `name` | string | `"Rocci"` | Required non-empty |
| `identifier` | string | `"dev.rocci.app"` | Reverse-DNS; alphanumeric, `.`, `-` |
| `version` | string? | unset | Optional |

**Errors:** empty name; identifier too short, missing `.`, leading/trailing `.`, `..`.
**Used by:** `validate`, `bundle`, preview window title.

## Windows

At least one `[[windows]]`. Labels must be unique. Dimensions are logical pixels.

| Field | Type | Default | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `label` | string | required | Unique |
| `title` | string | app name | Window title |
| `url` | string | `"/"` | Route loaded in the webview |
| `width` / `height` | float | 1040 / 760 | |
| `min_width` / `min_height` | float? | 720 / 560 | Optional |
| `visible` | bool | `true` | |

**Used by:** preview host / bundle. Multi-window Roc chrome is not fully wired
(**planned**).

## HTTP

| Field | Type | Default | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `host` | string | `"127.0.0.1"` | `127.0.0.1` or `localhost` only |
| `port` | u16 | `0` | `0` = ephemeral |
| `redirect_trailing_slash` | bool | `true` | 308 between `/page` and `/page/` |

**Errors:** `0.0.0.0` or any non-loopback host.
**Used by:** `run`, `bundle`. Container bind address is an environment override,
not this field.

## Security

| Field | Type | Default | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `csp` | string? | self + `'unsafe-eval'` | Datastar uses `Function` |
| `allowed_origins` | string[] | `[]` | Explicit `http(s)` origins |

**Used by:** preview host. Custom CSP only when you understand every source.

## Assets

| Field | Type | Default | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `directory` | path? | unset | Asset tree |
| `embed` | bool | `true` | Bundle embedding |
| `datastar` | version string or `false` | unset | Not `true`. Leading `v` stripped |

**Errors:** `datastar = true`; empty or illegal version characters.
**Used by:** `run`, `datastar pin/update`, `build --release`.

## Development

Key is `[development]`, not `[dev]`.

| Field | Type | Default | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `frontend_url` | URL? | unset | Loopback HTTP(S) if set |
| `backend_url` | URL? | unset | Loopback HTTP(S) if set |
| `reload` | bool | `true` | Live reload |
| `devtools` | bool | `true` | Developer tools |

**Used by:** `run` / preview.

## Bundle

| Field | Type | Default | Notes |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `identifier` | string? | app identifier | |
| `app` | path? | unset | App source |
| `macos_plist` | path? | unset | Info.plist |
| `[[bundle.resources]]` | `{from, to}` | `[]` | Copy into the bundle |

**Used by:** `bundle`. macOS only for `.app`.

## Environment

`ROCCI_CONFIG` overrides the config path. `rocci validate` is the check
command.

**Related:** [CLI validate](/docs/reference/cli/#validate), [Package](/docs/applications/package/).
